        }
      }
    },
    "Custom icon uses dynamic appearance": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apparence dynamique pour l’icône personnalisée"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dark Appearance": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apparence sombre"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Detected Menu Bar Items": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Éléments détectés dans la barre des menus"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Detecting menu bar items…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Détection des éléments de la barre des menus…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Display images of individual menu bar items.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Afficher les images des éléments individuels de la barre des menus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Display the icon as a monochrome image that dynamically adjusts to match the menu bar's appearance. This setting removes all color from the icon, but ensures consistent rendering with both light and dark backgrounds.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Afficher l'icône sous forme monochrome et l'adapter dynamiquement à l'apparence de la barre des menus. Ce réglage supprime les couleurs de l'icône, mais garantit un rendu cohérent sur les arrière-plans clairs et foncés."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Done": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fait"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag to arrange your menu bar items into different sections.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Faites glisser les éléments de la barre des menus pour les organiser en différentes sections."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dynamic": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dynamique"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ERROR": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ERREUR"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enable secondary context menu": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activer le menu contextuel secondaire"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enable the Glace Bar": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activer la « Glace Bar »"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enable the always-hidden section": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activer la section cachée"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Focused app": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App active"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Full": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pleine largeur"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "General": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Général"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Get real-time information about the menu bar.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Obtenir les informations de la barre des menus en temps réel."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Glace": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Glace"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Glace Settings…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Réglages de Glace…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Glace can work in a limited mode without this permission.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sans ces autorisations, Glace fonctionnera en mode restreint."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Glace cannot arrange menu bar items in automatically hidden menu bars.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Glace ne peut pas réorganiser les éléments de la barre des menus lorsque celle-ci est masquée automatiquement."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Glace cannot display menu bar items for automatically hidden menu bars": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Glace ne peut pas afficher les éléments lorsque la barre des menus est masquée automatiquement"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Glace cannot edit the appearance of automatically hidden menu bars.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Glace ne peut pas modifier l'apparence de la barre des menus lorsqu'elle est masquée automatiquement."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Glace could not read MenuBarAgent yet. Try refreshing after the menu bar finishes updating.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Glace ne peut pas encore lire MenuBarAgent. Actualisez après la mise à jour de la barre des menus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Glace icon": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Icône Glace"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Glace appearance overlays remain available on GoldenGate. Apple still controls menu bar item placement with the system double arrow.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les superpositions d’apparence de Glace restent disponibles sur GoldenGate. Apple contrôle toujours la disposition des éléments avec la double flèche du système."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Glace is a fork of Ice by Jordan Baird.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Glace est un fork d’Ice créé par Jordan Baird."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Glace needs this to:": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Glace a besoin de cette autorisation pour :"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Glace needs your permission to manage the menu bar.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Glace a besoin de votre autorisation pour gérer la barre des menus."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Go to Advanced Settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Accéder aux réglages avancés"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GoldenGate Compatibility Mode": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mode de compatibilité GoldenGate"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GoldenGate groups extra menu bar items behind the double arrow. Glace detects the items with Accessibility, but macOS no longer allows the legacy divider and drag system to move them safely.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GoldenGate regroupe les éléments supplémentaires derrière la double flèche. Glace les détecte grâce à Accessibilité, mais macOS ne permet plus à l’ancien système de séparateurs et de glisser-déposer de les déplacer de manière fiable."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GoldenGate manages hidden sections, item placement, and reveal behavior. Glace disables the legacy advanced controls here because they cannot be applied reliably on macOS 27.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GoldenGate gère les sections masquées, la disposition des éléments et leur affichage. Glace désactive ici les anciennes commandes avancées, car elles ne peuvent pas être appliquées de façon fiable sous macOS 27."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gradient": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dégradée"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Grant Permission": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
